################################################################################
################################################################################
################################################################################
# NOTES:
#  - 8 Pipes, each with 4 BlackhawkCores
#  - Each pipe has 20 logical ports (18 = management port, 19 = loopback)
#  - Only two pipes have management ports: 1 and 5
#  - Every pipe has a loopback port
#  - Pipe 0, logical port 0 is reserved, logical ports start at 1
#  - All other pipes, logical ports start at 0
#  - Only 144 logical ports are available to map to front panel ports
#    * This config design supports: 16x QSFP-DD ports and 128x SFP56 ports
#    * Breaking out the QSFP-DD ports is not allowed
#
# Definitions:
#  <port> = logical port
#  <dport> = diag shell port
#  <physical port number> = SoC PHY number
#
# Specify the logical port to physical port mapping:
#     portmap_<port>=<physical port number>:<bandwidth in Gb>
#
# Specify the logical port to diag port mapping:
#     dport_map_port_<port>=<dport>
# 
# Callouts:
#  1. <port> is dynamically selected on breakout ports within the same Pipe
# 
################################################################################
### Pipe 0: BC0 thru BC3

